WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Data loss prevention is enabled on the agent.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
The app host posts a test card number over HTTPS.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:16.000
The agent reads it before encryption and raises a critical alert.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The audit log names the pattern and the process that sent it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
In the console, in its standalone demo mode with sample data, an alert names the binary, the user and the workload.
